### Requests for the REST Client extension (humao.rest-client).
### Start the API first (cabal run ledger-api), then click "Send Request"
### above any block.
###
### Send one of the login requests first. REST Client remembers the session
### cookie and sends it with every request after that, like a browser.
### The demo password is in the README.

### Health check (no login needed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### Log in as alice (owns the acme-* accounts)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice", "password": "ledger-demo-2026" }

### Log in as admin (sees everything, makes deposits)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "ledger-demo-2026" }

### Who am I?
GET http://localhost:8080/api/me

### List accounts (alice sees only hers; admin sees all)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts

### Transfer with an idempotency key (as alice; send it twice: same result, money moves once)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: payroll-1

{ "from": "acme-ops", "to": "acme-payroll", "amountCents": 150000, "memo": "September payroll" }

### Same key, different request (expect 409 idempotency_key_reused)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: payroll-1

{ "from": "acme-ops", "to": "acme-payroll", "amountCents": 1 }

### Pay another company's account (as alice)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "acme-ops", "to": "globex-ops", "amountCents": 32000, "memo": "Invoice GX-1080" }

### Send from someone else's account (as alice: expect 404; as admin: 403)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "globex-ops", "to": "acme-ops", "amountCents": 100 }

### Overdraft (as alice: expect 422 insufficient_funds)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "acme-payroll", "to": "acme-ops", "amountCents": 99999999 }

### Deposit from outside the ledger (admin only; alice gets 403)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "acme-payroll", "amountCents": 50000 }

### Open a new account for yourself
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "acme-travel", "name": "Acme Travel" }

### Entries for payroll
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/acme-payroll/entries

### Log out
POST http://localhost:8080/api/logout
